                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0cba5158-27d5-43fa-89cf-cfc68aa79980",
                                "sense_id": "05079f82-bad6-338d-bfb7-c6fb904d7dfd",
                                "text": "Многочисленная челядь её, разжирев и поседев в её передней и девичьей, делала, что хотела, наперерыв обкрадывая умирающую старуху.",
                                "translation": "Her numerous domestics, growing fat and old in her ante-chamber and servants' hall, did just as they liked, and vied with each other in robbing the aged Countess in the most bare-faced manner.",
                                "english": "Her numerous domestics, growing fat and old in her ante-chamber and servants' hall, did just as they liked, and vied with each other in robbing the aged Countess in the most bare-faced manner."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
